{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "完整歌曲合成",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "把续写分段合成为完整歌曲。源必须是 `suno-extend` 产物。无版本维度。可指定 `audio_format`。合成本身不计费。"
  },
  "tags": [{ "name": "音频（Audio）/Suno" }],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "使用 MAPI Bearer Token 认证。格式：`Authorization: Bearer sk-xxxxxx`。"
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/music/generations": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["音频（Audio）/Suno"],
        "summary": "完整歌曲合成",
        "description": "把片段合成为完整歌曲。\n\n- 源 `task_id` **必须是 `suno-extend` 续写产生的分段**。普通一次性生成不能作为源，否则提交期 400。\n- 本接口用于合成一条续写链，不是任意两首歌曲的拼接工具。\n- **无版本维度**：不要传 `version`。\n- `audio_format` 可选：`mp3` / `m4a` / `wav`。\n- 合成本身免费；前置 `suno-extend` 按续写价格单独计费。\n- 完成后从 `result.music[]` 取完整歌曲 `audio_url`。通过 `GET /v1/music/generations/{task_id}` 轮询。",
        "operationId": "suno-concat",
        "security": [{ "BearerAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "model": { "type": "string", "const": "suno-concat", "description": "固定填写 `suno-concat`。", "examples": ["suno-concat"] },
                  "task_id": { "type": "string", "description": "必须是 `suno-extend` 续写任务的 ID。" },
                  "audio_index": { "type": "integer", "default": 1, "minimum": 1 },
                  "audio_format": { "type": "string", "enum": ["mp3", "m4a", "wav"], "description": "输出音频格式。" }
                },
                "required": ["model", "task_id"]
              },
              "examples": {
                "suno-concat": {
                  "summary": "完整歌曲合成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "suno-concat",
                    "task_id": "task_extendXXXXXXXX",
                    "audio_index": 1,
                    "audio_format": "mp3"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务提交成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "code": { "type": "integer", "examples": [200] },
                    "message": { "type": "string", "examples": ["success"] },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["submitted"] },
                          "task_id": { "type": "string" }
                        },
                        "required": ["status", "task_id"]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": ["code", "data"]
                },
                "example": { "code": 200, "message": "success", "data": [{ "status": "submitted", "task_id": "task_aehCmxJ5YUNOIQGgkhvxaco4T9P2h3Dw" }] }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误或源不是续写产物",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "code": { "type": "string", "examples": ["invalid_request"] },
                    "message": { "type": "string" },
                    "data": { "description": "错误附加数据，可为空" }
                  },
                  "required": ["code", "message"]
                },
                "example": { "code": "invalid_request", "message": "task_id is required", "data": null }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
